OL,5,G1650 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FThe last visit of the week is to
OL,7,     FJodie and Enya's Hideout Hotel in
OL,8,     FHull. The guests are impressed by
OL,9,     Fthe self-catered apartments, until
OL,10,     Fa dramatic breakfast derails one
OL,11,     Fpair's stay.
OL,12,G1720 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FIt's payment day, and the B&Bers
OL,14,     Fdebate their differences on
OL,15,     Feverything from sleep issues to
OL,16,     Fbathroom hygiene, before the
OL,17,     Fwinning B&B is crowned.
